---
import { Code } from '@astrojs/starlight/components';
interface Props {
  lang?: 'zh' | 'en';
}
const { lang = 'zh' } = Astro.props;
const en = lang === 'en';
---

<aside
  class="mac-help not-content"
  aria-label={en ? 'Help opening the macOS Beta' : 'macOS Beta 首次打开说明'}
>
  <div class="intro">
    <div>
      <span class="badge">macOS · Beta</span>
      <h3>{en ? 'Why this happens' : '为什么会出现这个提示？'}</h3>
      <p>
        {
          en
            ? 'The Beta app is not publisher-signed or notarized by Apple. macOS may block it on first launch; this warning alone does not mean the file is damaged.'
            : 'Beta 版尚未使用正式发布者证书签名，也未经 Apple 公证。macOS 首次打开时可能拦截；仅凭这条提示，不能判断文件是否损坏。'
        }
      </p>
    </div>
    <a
      class="warning-image"
      href="/screenshots/macos-beta-warning.png"
      aria-label={en ? 'Enlarge the macOS warning screenshot' : '放大 macOS 报错截图'}
    >
      <img
        src="/screenshots/macos-beta-warning.png"
        alt={en
          ? 'macOS reports that Codex Switch is damaged (Chinese dialog)'
          : 'macOS 提示 Codex Switch 已损坏，无法打开'}
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <span>{en ? 'View screenshot ↗' : '查看报错截图 ↗'}</span>
    </a>
  </div>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <strong>{en ? 'Verify the download' : '确认下载来源'}</strong><p>
        {
          en
            ? 'Use the installer from this project’s GitHub Release and confirm that its SHA-256 matches the published checksum.'
            : '确认安装包来自本项目 GitHub Release，并核对 SHA-256 与发布的校验值一致。'
        }
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>{en ? 'Move the app to Applications' : '移入「应用程序」'}</strong><p>
        {
          en
            ? 'Open the DMG and drag Codex Switch into Applications.'
            : '打开 DMG，将 Codex Switch 拖入「应用程序」。'
        }
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>{en ? 'Run this command in Terminal' : '在「终端」执行命令'}</strong><p>
        {
          en
            ? 'Paste the command below and press Return.'
            : '复制下方命令，粘贴到「终端」并按回车。'
        }
      </p><Code
        code={'xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine "/Applications/Codex Switch.app"'}
        lang="bash"
        title={en ? 'Terminal' : '终端'}
      />
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>{en ? 'Open Codex Switch again' : '重新打开应用'}</strong><p>
        {
          en
            ? 'Launch Codex Switch from Applications. If it still fails, keep the error message and report it.'
            : '从「应用程序」打开 Codex Switch。若仍无法打开，请保留报错信息并反馈。'
        }
      </p>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p class="footnote">
    {
      en
        ? 'This command only removes the app’s download quarantine attribute. It does not disable system-wide security or repair a damaged file.'
        : '此命令仅移除该应用的下载隔离标记，不会关闭系统全局安全保护，也不能修复真正损坏的文件。'
    }
  </p>
</aside>
<style>
  .mac-help {
    margin-block: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--docs-border);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: var(--docs-surface);
  }
  .intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 180px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--docs-border);
  }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
    background: var(--docs-soft);
    color: var(--docs-muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  h3 {
    margin: 0.65rem 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--docs-ink);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  p {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
    color: var(--docs-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .warning-image {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--docs-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    cursor: zoom-in;
  }
  .mac-help .warning-image img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 180px;
    margin: 0 auto 0.4rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--docs-border);
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
  }
  ol {
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: steps;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
  }
  li {
    position: relative;
    counter-increment: steps;
    padding-left: 2.4rem;
  }
  li + li {
    margin-top: 1.15rem;
  }
  li::before {
    content: counter(steps);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.05rem;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 1.55rem;
    height: 1.55rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--docs-soft);
    color: var(--docs-ink);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  strong {
    color: var(--docs-ink);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .mac-help :global(.expressive-code) {
    margin-block: 0.75rem 0;
  }
  .footnote {
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--docs-border);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .mac-help {
      padding: 1rem;
    }
    .intro {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.85rem;
    }
    .warning-image {
      justify-self: start;
    }
    .mac-help .warning-image img {
      max-width: 150px;
    }
    li {
      padding-left: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
